{
  "primitive": "holder_operation_key_tree",
  "description": "Merkle tree over per-operation holder public keys. leaf_hash = SHA3-256(0x00 || public_key_bytes). Internal node = SHA3-256(0x01 || left || right). Odd child promoted unchanged. The authorization commits to the root (holder_key_set_root); each commitment discloses one leaf key + its inclusion proof.",
  "leaf_hash_rule": "SHA3-256(0x00 || public_key_bytes), lowercase hex",
  "node_hash_rule": "SHA3-256(0x01 || left_bytes || right_bytes), lowercase hex",
  "note": "public_key_bytes here are deterministic placeholders (a 32-byte run of a constant) so the vector is reproducible; the Merkle layer hashes arbitrary bytes, ML-DSA validity is not needed to pin leaf hash / root / proof.",
