  "disclosure_cases_note": "Full disclosures (§11) checked against a root by the membership procedure (§12) and the failure conditions (§13). expected_valid is the verdict and failure names the condition. A JSON number that is not an integer, a string where an integer is required, an additional or missing member, a sibling that is not 64 lowercase hex, and non-canonical base64 all fail.",
